Try: ?name docs · :pin/:fold/:rerun <id> · interactive keys require a TTY
Error [E0712]: this `#Grant` region uses the effect `Panic`, which it has no authority for
  --> <repl:2>:1:40
    |
  1 | #Grant(caps: FS) { fs.write("denied.txt", "must not run") ?? panic("write failed") }
    |                                        ^^^
 Why: `#Grant(…)` grants only `FS`; an effect reached inside — even through a call — needs authority in scope to perform it
 Fix: add `Panic` to the `#Grant(…)` list, or move that work outside the grant
